<!Celes-0.1.5>
<title>{Donors to the Godot Engine Project}

<header -size=1>{Donors to the Godot Engine project}


<list -bullet=circle>{Godot Engine is a non-profit project developed by a community of voluntary}
<list -bullet=circle>{contributors, as well as occasional paid contributors thanks to the financial}
<list -bullet=circle>{support of generous donors.}

<list -bullet=circle>{The ways to donate to the project, as well as details on how the funds are}
<list -bullet=circle>{used, are described on [Godot's website](https://fund.godotengine.org).}

<list -bullet=circle>{The following is a list of the current monthly donors, who will have their}
<list -bullet=circle>{generous deed immortalized in the next stable release of Godot Engine.}

